  "id": "e-in-one-s-opinion",
  "lexicon": "zkv",
  "number": 180,
  "kind": "phrase",
  "headword": "in one’s opinion",
  "star": true,
  "senses": [
    {
      "zh": "根据某人的看法"
    }
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "In my opinion"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " he is not right."
        }
      ],
      "zh": "在我看来，他是错的。"
    }
  ],
  "tip": [
    {
      "id": "p1",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "in one’s opinion 是常考词组，常出现在保持句意基本不变的句型转换练习中，所以学生一定要知道：in one’s opinion 与 I think 意思相同，在句中可以互换。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p2",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "例如："
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "In my opinion"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": ", children can learn about responsibility from doing some housework."
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "= "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "I think"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " that children can learn about responsibility from doing some housework."
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "在我看来，孩子们可以从做一些家务中学会责任心。"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
